  lines:
  - The radio is already transmitting a signal.
  - "\u2014mitting again. It has been 2 days, 7 hours, and 24 minutes since losing
    contact\u2014"
  - Hello? Can you hear me?
  - "Hello? Oh thank goodness you\u2019re here."
  - "This is Captain Sharp speaking. Listen, I don\u2019t have much time left."
  - "This planet, there\u2019s something connected to it. It woke up and that\u2019s
    when we lost signal."
  - "\u201CIt\u201D? What is \u201CIt\u201D? Where are you, we\u2019re here to help."
  - "It\u2019s getting closer. \r\nIt\u2019s too late for me, save the others."
  - What is your location? Are there any others with you?
  - The channel list is in the desk drawer. I think I saw Doctor Moss go south west
    from the tower.
  - 'A scream can just barely be made out as the channel is flooded with static. '
  - This goes on for a few seconds until the static slowly dissipates. A low grumbling
    can be heard in the distance.
  - Captain Sharp?
  - ...
  - "That static must have been \u201Cit\u201D messing with the signal. I\u2019ll
    have to keep an ear out for that."
  - I better let the rescue team know about Sharp.
  - Use the portable radio located in the HUD to call the Rescue team.
  - You must be outside near the radio tower to get a hold of them.
